Reason:
platform_get_resource_byname can return NULL. The subsequent call to resource_size(res) dereferences the NULL pointer, causing a crash. The assignment of memory_size is performed before the error check from devm_ioremap_resource, so the NULL dereference occurs before any validation.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
