    return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(fiu->memory), "Failed to map flash memory window\n");
fiu->memory_size = min_t(size_t, resource_size(res), MAX_MEMORY_SIZE_TOTAL);
Reason:
The assignment of fiu->memory_size is moved after the error check for devm_ioremap_resource. devm_ioremap_resource returns an error if res is NULL, so the assignment only executes when res is valid, preventing the NULL pointer dereference.

